[options]
[A.]
<$Playsound,forWind2.wav>

                                               <h2>Defending Wind Village<a href="#mission6">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>

                                                        ~[IwindFactory.3]
<br>                                                                                                           ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br>
<i>You hear a loud boom and see smoke.  When the smoke clears you are standing on a strange island.</i>
<p>A deep voice cries out! <i>"Is this the help you brought me Almighty Wind Fury?
I hope he fights better than he looks."</i>
<p>
You think to yourself:  ~I"I would love to show this coward a thing or two.  Better than I look - Huh!"~.<br>
You respond with: ~I"wind Fury, why have you brought me to this forsaken land?"~.<br>
King of ~[ImanaBolt.0]~oWind~[ImanaBolt.0]~. yells <i>"Forsaken land, How dare you!"</i>
<p>
Enough!  You two don't have much time to waste arguing.  Hades henchman are mounting an attack as we speak.  Good luck to you both.<br>
<p>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                                   <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                             <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>               <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Help Save this Wretched Place</a>               <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I wanna Leave!</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestMove3.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.


[ai8PriestDead]
{sw_god2} speaks to you:<br>
<i>"Here is a gift of Knowledge I grant to you, for your demonstration of your skill"
$Menu=~[IwindArcher.75]~yCrossBow,GetTechnology,140

[ai6PriestDead]
{sw_god2} speaks to you:<br>
"The power of wind will even rattle the Bones of the ~kDEATH<i> Fury."
<p>
With each priest you sacrifice, you become more powerful.
$Menu=~yAirShip~[IwindBalloon.*],GetTechnology,141

[ai4PriestDead]
The {sw_god5}'s Warriors are no match for you!<br>
$Menu=~[IwindAviary]~yDevil Maker,GetTechnology,139

[ai7PriestDead]
<$ChangeMoney,1500>
The {sw_god2} says:<br>
<i>"Stormpower, to aid our cause"</i>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai5PriestDead]
The {sw_god2} says:<br>
<i>"Here is food for our Battle. May the power of wind blind our enemie's eyes, and
make them stumble and fall</i>
<$ChangeMoney,5000>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0



[ai3PriestDead]
Here's some storm power crystals to help you
<ChangeMoney,1000>
$Button=OK,tell,henchmanDead


[henchmanDead]
<h2>You receive a message.</h2><br>
     ~[Ipriest.167]
<p>
<i>You will pay for killing my henchman!<br>
                --The ~{sw_god5}</i></h2>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0



[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
There is joy in the streets of wind Village as the Nimbians thank you
for saving them from ~kDeath~.!
<p>
However, the King of ~[ImanaBolt.0]~oWind~[ImanaBolt.0]~. is absent from the celebration!
<p>
~I"What an ingrate!"~., you say to yourself. ~I"The King of ~[ImanaBolt.0]~oWind~[ImanaBolt.0]~I didn't
even thank me for my help!"~.
<$Config,sw_m6=0>
<$Config,sw_m12=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=2000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=2000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=6>
$Button=On to Repelling Hades forces!,MissionBegin,sw_m12


[Failed]
<?{sw_difficulty1}>
<h2>You receive a message from the Wind Fury.</h2>
<i>"I can help you no longer."</i>
<p>
Then you see another puff of smoke.<br>
You traitor!  Now you will die on my altar for this traitorous deed.
<$Config,sw_m6=0>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
$Button=On to Hades Haltar,MissionBegin,sw_m24
$Button=Leave,Tell,guideHades.overview
</?>
<?!{sw_difficulty}>
<h2>You receive a message from the Wind Fury.</h2>
<i>"I can help you only once. The power of {sw_hades}<i> is
 very strong! Please don't fail again!"</i>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=15000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=5000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=0>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=2000>
$Button=I won't fail again!,MissionBegin,sw_m6
</?>



